From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 08:21:52 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: awinic,aw88395: Add the AW88263
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The AW88263 is an I2S amplifier with a boost converter and current and
voltage sensing, in the same family and with the same properties as the
AW88261 already in this binding: an I2C address, a reset line and the
channel that picks its profile from the firmware file.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
index 7d64b38e4..5d0580b72 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/awinic,aw88395.yaml
@@ -21,6 +21,7 @@ properties:
       - awinic,aw88083
       - awinic,aw88166
       - awinic,aw88261
+      - awinic,aw88263
       - awinic,aw88395
       - awinic,aw88399
 
